1
00:00:00,563 --> 00:00:03,393
(Bernadette:)Did you...
A plaque?

2
00:00:03,399 --> 00:00:05,969
(Sheldon:)Nobody wants to see this.

3
00:00:05,968 --> 00:00:08,538
Well, change "plaque"
to "mixed-race couple"

4
00:00:08,537 --> 00:00:11,067
(Leonard:)and you are my grandma.

5
00:00:11,073 --> 00:00:13,643
I can't take this anymore.

6
00:00:15,244 --> 00:00:18,314
(Sheldon:)Bert. Bert.
Bert!

7
00:00:18,314 --> 00:00:19,544
(Bert:)Come in.

8
00:00:19,548 --> 00:00:22,078
(Sheldon:)All right, let's do this...

9
00:00:26,422 --> 00:00:27,952
(Sheldon:)Bert?

10
00:00:27,957 --> 00:00:29,327
(Sheldon:)We need to talk.

11
00:00:29,325 --> 00:00:30,525
(Penny:)What happened to you?

12
00:00:30,526 --> 00:00:33,156
(Sheldon:)Rock, rock, water fountain.

13
00:00:35,798 --> 00:00:37,198
(Sheldon:)I am not proud of this.

14
00:00:37,199 --> 00:00:40,269
(Sheldon:)But I have been envious
of your recent success.

15
00:00:40,269 --> 00:00:43,809
(Bert:)Wow, I won the MacArthur Grant,

16
00:00:43,806 --> 00:00:45,236
(Bert:)everyone's jealous of me.

17
00:00:45,241 --> 00:00:48,781
(Bert:)Once I get Lasik, I'll be
out of things to wish for.

18
00:00:49,879 --> 00:00:52,079
(Sheldon:)I was hoping by admitting
my weakness to you,

19
00:00:52,081 --> 00:00:53,981
(Sheldon:)I'd somehow be unburdened.

20
00:00:53,983 --> 00:00:55,253
(Bert:)Is it working?
No.

21
00:00:55,251 --> 00:00:56,321
(Sheldon:)Now that you know my weakness,

22
00:00:56,318 --> 00:00:57,618
(Sheldon:)I hate you more than ever.

23
00:00:59,555 --> 00:01:02,325
(Bert:)Well, you know, we're
both pretty smart.

